{"seq":2,"slug":"packaging-distribution","title":"应用打包分发与自动更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/advanced/packaging-distribution","wordCount":846,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用打包分发与自动更新\">应用打包分发与自动更新</h1><p>将 Electron 应用从开发环境交付到终端用户手中，需要经历打包、代码签名、公证（Notarization）、分发和自动更新等完整的发布管线。这个过程涉及三大操作系统各不相同的分发机制和安全要求——macOS 的 Gatekeeper 强制公证、Windows 的 SmartScreen 信誉体系、Linux 的多格式分发生态。2026 年 Electron 41 新增的 ASAR Integrity Digest 和 MSIX 自动更新进一步丰富了安全分发的工具集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源码] --&gt; B[构建 electron-vite]&#10;    B --&gt; C[打包 Forge/Builder]&#10;    C --&gt; D[代码签名]&#10;    D --&gt; E[公证 macOS]&#10;    D --&gt; F[MSIX 签名 Windows]&#10;    E --&gt; G[分发渠道]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[自动更新服务器]&#10;    H --&gt; I[客户端增量更新]\">graph LR\n    A[源码] --&gt; B[构建 electron-vite]\n    B --&gt; C[打包 Forge/Builder]\n    C --&gt; D[代码签名]\n    D --&gt; E[公证 macOS]\n    D --&gt; F[MSIX 签名 Windows]\n    E --&gt; G[分发渠道]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[自动更新服务器]\n    H --&gt; I[客户端增量更新]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>安装包格式</th>\n<th>签名要求</th>\n<th>自动更新方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>.dmg / .zip / .pkg</td>\n<td>Apple Developer ID + 公证</td>\n<td>Squirrel.Mac / electron-updater</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>.exe (NSIS) / .msi / .msix</td>\n<td>EV Code Signing Certificate</td>\n<td>Squirrel.Windows / MSIX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>.deb / .rpm / .AppImage / .snap</td>\n<td>可选 GPG 签名</td>\n<td>electron-updater / AppImage delta</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"asar-打包与完整性校验\">ASAR 打包与完整性校验</h2><p>ASAR（Atom Shell Archive）是 Electron 专用的归档格式，将应用的所有源文件打包为一个文件，避免 Windows 上路径过长和文件数过多的问题，同时提升文件读取性能。</p>\n<p>Electron 41 引入了 ASAR Integrity Digest——将 ASAR 的完整性校验信息嵌入应用签名中，启动时自动验证防篡改：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启用 ASAR Integrity Digest（需要 @electron/asar v4.1.0+）&#10;npx asar integrity-digest on /path/to/YourApp.app&#10;# 之后必须重新签名&#10;codesign --force --deep --sign &quot;Developer ID&quot; YourApp.app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用 ASAR Integrity Digest（需要 @electron/asar v4.1.0+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> asar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> integrity-digest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /path/to/YourApp.app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 之后必须重新签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">codesign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --deep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Developer ID\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> YourApp.app</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这解决了一个长期存在的安全问题：即使应用已签名，攻击者仍可能替换 ASAR 内的 JavaScript 文件而不破坏外层签名。Integrity Digest 将 ASAR 内容的哈希纳入签名验证范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"macos-代码签名与公证\">macOS 代码签名与公证</h2><p>macOS Gatekeeper 要求所有分发的应用必须使用 Apple Developer ID 签名并经过公证（Notarization），否则用户打开时会收到&quot;无法验证开发者&quot;的警告：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// forge.config.ts - macOS 签名与公证配置&#10;{&#10;  packagerConfig: {&#10;    osxSign: {&#10;      identity: &#39;Developer ID Application: Your Company (TEAMID)&#39;,&#10;      hardenedRuntime: true,&#10;      entitlements: &#39;./entitlements.plist&#39;,&#10;      entitlementsInherit: &#39;./entitlements.plist&#39;&#10;    },&#10;    osxNotarize: {&#10;      appleId: process.env.APPLE_ID!,&#10;      appleIdPassword: process.env.APPLE_APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD!,&#10;      teamId: process.env.APPLE_TEAM_ID!&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// forge.config.ts - macOS 签名与公证配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  packagerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    osxSign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      identity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Developer ID Application: Your Company (TEAMID)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      hardenedRuntime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      entitlements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./entitlements.plist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      entitlementsInherit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./entitlements.plist'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    osxNotarize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      appleId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">APPLE_ID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      appleIdPassword</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">APPLE_APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      teamId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">APPLE_TEAM_ID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>entitlements.plist</code> 定义应用请求的系统权限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;plist version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;dict&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;true/&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;true/&gt;&#10;&lt;/dict&gt;&#10;&lt;/plist&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UTF-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>JIT 和未签名内存权限是 Electron 应用必须声明的——V8 引擎需要 JIT 编译 JavaScript。</p>\n<h2 id=\"windows-签名与-msix\">Windows 签名与 MSIX</h2><p>Windows SmartScreen 根据签名证书的「信誉度」决定是否向用户显示安全警告。新证书需要时间积累信誉，EV（Extended Validation）证书可跳过此等待期。</p>\n<p>Electron 41 新增 MSIX 自动更新支持——MSIX 是 Windows 的现代应用包格式，支持增量更新和 Windows Store 分发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://update.example.com/releases&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;1.2.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;msix&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://update.example.com/releases/app-1.2.0.msix&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;notes&quot;: &quot;Bug fixes and performance improvements&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://update.example.com/releases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"msix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://update.example.com/releases/app-1.2.0.msix\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MSIX 更新的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>系统级增量更新（只下载差异块）</li>\n<li>自动回滚（更新失败自动恢复前版本）</li>\n<li>与 Windows Store 分发兼容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自动更新架构\">自动更新架构</h2><p><code>electron-updater</code>（配合 electron-builder）或 Electron 内置的 <code>autoUpdater</code> 模块实现客户端自动更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { autoUpdater } from &#39;electron-updater&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 配置更新服务器&#10;autoUpdater.setFeedURL({&#10;  provider: &#39;github&#39;,&#10;  owner: &#39;your-org&#39;,&#10;  repo: &#39;your-app&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 检查更新（建议在应用启动后延迟执行）&#10;autoUpdater.checkForUpdatesAndNotify();&#10;&#10;// 更新生命周期事件&#10;autoUpdater.on(&#39;update-available&#39;, (info) =&gt; {&#10;  // 通知用户有可用更新&#10;});&#10;&#10;autoUpdater.on(&#39;download-progress&#39;, (progress) =&gt; {&#10;  // 显示下载进度&#10;  mainWindow.setProgressBar(progress.percent / 100);&#10;});&#10;&#10;autoUpdater.on(&#39;update-downloaded&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  // 提示用户重启应用&#10;  dialog&#10;    .showMessageBox({&#10;      message: &#39;更新已下载，重启以安装&#39;,&#10;      buttons: [&#39;立即重启&#39;, &#39;稍后&#39;],&#10;    })&#10;    .then(({ response }) =&gt; {&#10;      if (response === 0) autoUpdater.quitAndInstall();&#10;    });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { autoUpdater } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electron-updater'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 配置更新服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">autoUpdater.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setFeedURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'github'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  owner: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'your-org'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  repo: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'your-app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检查更新（建议在应用启动后延迟执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">autoUpdater.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkForUpdatesAndNotify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 更新生命周期事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">autoUpdater.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'update-available'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 通知用户有可用更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">autoUpdater.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki