#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'更新已下载，重启以安装'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      buttons: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'立即重启'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'稍后'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) autoUpdater.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">quitAndInstall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"增量更新与带宽优化\">增量更新与带宽优化</h2><p>全量更新意味着每次都下载 80-200MB 的完整安装包，对于频繁更新的应用这是不可接受的带宽消耗。增量更新策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MSIX 增量</strong>（Windows）：系统级 block-level diff，只传输变化的块</li>\n<li><strong>electron-updater 差异更新</strong>：基于 <code>blockmap</code> 文件计算差异，只下载变更的数据块</li>\n<li><strong>ASAR 差异</strong>：只更新 ASAR 中变更的文件，但需自定义实现</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# electron-builder 自动生成 blockmap 文件&#10;# 更新时客户端对比本地和远程 blockmap，只下载差异块&#10;# 典型节省：小版本更新从 150MB 降至 5-15MB\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># electron-builder 自动生成 blockmap 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 更新时客户端对比本地和远程 blockmap，只下载差异块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 典型节省：小版本更新从 150MB 降至 5-15MB</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ci-cd-发布流水线\">CI/CD 发布流水线</h2><p>完整的自动化发布流水线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 示例&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        os: [macos-latest, windows-latest, ubuntu-latest]&#10;    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install&#10;      - run: pnpm build&#10;      - run: pnpm forge:make&#10;      - run: pnpm forge:publish&#10;        env:&#10;          APPLE_ID: ${{ secrets.APPLE_ID }}&#10;          APPLE_PASSWORD: ${{ secrets.APPLE_PASSWORD }}&#10;          WINDOWS_CERT: ${{ secrets.WINDOWS_CERT }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        os</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">macos-latest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">windows-latest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ matrix.os }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm forge:make</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm forge:publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          APPLE_ID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.APPLE_ID }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          APPLE_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.APPLE_PASSWORD }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          WINDOWS_CERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.WINDOWS_CERT }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ASAR Integrity Digest（Electron 41）将文件完整性校验纳入应用签名</li>\n<li>macOS 发布必须签名 + 公证，否则 Gatekeeper 拒绝运行</li>\n<li>MSIX 格式提供系统级增量更新和自动回滚能力</li>\n<li>electron-updater 的 blockmap 机制将更新带宽从 150MB 降至 5-15MB</li>\n<li>CI/CD 管线应覆盖三平台构建、签名和自动发布</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../development/toolchain-engineering\">工程化工具链</a>——Electron Forge 的构建配置详解</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hubs/cs-fundamentals/ci-cd-pipelines/\">CI/CD 管线设计</a>——持续集成与持续交付的通用实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用打包分发与自动更新","id":"应用打包分发与自动更新"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ASAR 打包与完整性校验","id":"asar-打包与完整性校验"},{"level":2,"text":"macOS 代码签名与公证","id":"macos-代码签名与公证"},{"level":2,"text":"Windows 签名与 MSIX","id":"windows-签名与-msix"},{"level":2,"text":"自动更新架构","id":"自动更新架构"},{"level":2,"text":"增量更新与带宽优化","id":"增量更新与带宽优化"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 发布流水线","id":"ci-cd-发布流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"原生模块集成与 N-API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/advanced/native-modules"},"next":{"title":"Electron 与 Tauri 技术选型对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/advanced/electron-vs-tauri"}}